Package: wayshadow
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Wayland keystroke visualizer
 wayshadow is a lightweight overlay that displays keystrokes and mouse clicks
 in real time on Wayland compositors. It reads input via libinput/udev and
 renders an anti-aliased overlay using Cairo and Pango.
